{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/9e91f9a08e5d2c034091306d7581a969.poster.avif?t=1758047200\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/9e91f9a08e5d2c034091306d7581a969.webm?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/9e91f9a08e5d2c034091306d7581a969.mp4?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DESCRIPTION :</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long long time ago, color flowed freely in the skies and grounds of the planet of <i>Chromara</i>. All was well for a gazillion years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one colorful day\u2026..strange evil monsters fell from the sky. Ravenous in their hunger, they attacked and drained all traces of hue and colour from the planet. Ambushed\u00a0 and desaturated, Chromara turned a lifeless grey in their wake\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But deep in the heart of Chromara\u2026 there's still hope. The ancient <i>Rainbar</i>, a prism of all life on the planet, the last beacon of hope, pulsing with the final drops of colour, is still unconquered. If it\u2019s taken, all color is lost forever. The <i>Hue-Men</i> must fight to reclaim their world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time\u2026.. for <strong>CHROME-ADI!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FEATURES :</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <i><strong>Hue-Men </strong></i>in their fight against the invading <i>Chromies!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/298f9e3200bc2a7fa59b0f466c90e848.poster.avif?t=1758047200\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/298f9e3200bc2a7fa59b0f466c90e848.webm?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/298f9e3200bc2a7fa59b0f466c90e848.mp4?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix, match and unleash colourful attacks to protect the <i>Rainbar</i>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/6c457d647a87ffc7b98de84f9cfb0ce7.poster.avif?t=1758047200\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/6c457d647a87ffc7b98de84f9cfb0ce7.webm?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/6c457d647a87ffc7b98de84f9cfb0ce7.mp4?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, impossible to put down. Can you achieve that unbeatable high score?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resaturate the lost paintings of Chromara<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/cec85288146ddfbc3b051ee1c9308f9d.poster.avif?t=1758047200\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/cec85288146ddfbc3b051ee1c9308f9d.webm?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/cec85288146ddfbc3b051ee1c9308f9d.mp4?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new retro arcade blaster with modern gameplay. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/ac0753c07f58fb75625f05e8053418b1.poster.avif?t=1758047200\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/ac0753c07f58fb75625f05e8053418b1.webm?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/ac0753c07f58fb75625f05e8053418b1.mp4?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/c4d00f67ddaa7040b5c7bf6a4e4f284c.poster.avif?t=1758047200\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/c4d00f67ddaa7040b5c7bf6a4e4f284c.webm?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/extras/c4d00f67ddaa7040b5c7bf6a4e4f284c.mp4?t=1758047200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569990?t=1758047200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569990?t=1758047200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/dd8efea20e0079ea902766b3f15be826f37a9bb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758047200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569990/dd8efea20e0079ea902766b3f15be826f37a9bb2/caps